  "purpose": "Standalone, read-only legacy-decoder process; no calibre installation.",
  "modifications": [
    "Imports redirected to a local read-only compatibility layer.",
    "Only LRFDocument and LIT binary-HTML/manifest decoder retained.",
    "Bounded decompression replaces unbounded zlib.",
    "Read-only LRF metadata adapter and bounded native ABI added; unused complete-calibre application imports excluded.",
    "Only TextBlock and Styles retained from the LRF HTML renderer.",
    "LRF objects are parsed in isolated bounded streams; duplicate IDs, overlaps, truncated streams and total decoded size are checked.",
    "XML uses a narrow ElementTree/html5lib adapter, with no external entity loading.",
    "Rocket eBook index and compressed HTML chunks are decoded in memory with bounds and resource validation."
  ],
